<title>USA: West Perry SD, Pa., won by Mellon Bank.</title>
<headline>West Perry SD, Pa., won by Mellon Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mellon Bank, N.A. said it won $6.125 million of West Perry School District, Pa., general obligation bonds, Series of 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.682 percent without insurance recalculation.</p>
</text>
